On Error Goto E
Synchro Off
Amal 1,"Let R0=; Pause" : Print #1,Amalerr
Amal 1,"Let R0=1; Jump Z" : Print #1,Amalerr>-1
Amal 1,"For R0=1 To 3; Next R1" : Print #1,Amalerr
Amal 1,"A: Let R0=1; A: Pause" : Print #1,Amalerr
Amal 1,"AU(AU(" : Print #1,Amalerr
Amal 1,"eXit" : Print #1,Amalerr
Amal 1,"AU(Move 1,1,1; )" : Print #1,Amalerr
Amal 1,"PLay 1" : Print #1,Amalerr
Amal 1,"Let Q=1" : Print #1,Amalerr
Amal 99,"Let R0=1"
Amal 1,"Let R0=1" : Amal On 1 : Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(1,0)
Print #1,Amreg(26)
Print #1,Amreg(64,0)
Print #1,Amreg(1,10)
Print #1,Chanmv(64)
Print #1,Movon(-1)
Anim 1,"(1,2" : Print #1,Amalerr
Move X 1,"(1,2,3" : Print #1,Amalerr
Move Y 1,"(0,2,3)" : Print #1,Amalerr
Channel 2 To Screen Offset 5 : Amal 2,"Let X=1"
Channel 3 To Bob 9 : Amal 3,"Let X=1"
A$="Let R0=R0+1; Pause; Jump A; A: Let R1=R1+1; Pause; Jump A" : Amal 4,A$ : Amal On 4
For I=1 To 3 : Synchro : Next I : Print #1,Amreg(4,0);Amreg(4,1)
Amal 4,"Let R2=5" : Amal On 4 : Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(4,0);Amreg(4,1);Amreg(4,2)
Amal Off : Synchro On
Print #1,"end"
Goto FIN
E: Print #1,"error";Errn : Resume Next
FIN:
